### Quantitative Case & Force Analysis

| Metric / Dimension | Proposed (8 Microservices + K8s + Istio) | Recommended (Modular Monolith) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Code Density** | ~625 lines of code per microservice | 5,000 lines in single coherent codebase |
