---

### 3. Architecture Tradeoffs

| Advantage | Disadvantage / Cost |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Strict Insulation**: Carrier SDK breaking changes are contained within single adapter files, shielding all 19 domain modules. | **Mapping Overhead**: Requires writing and maintaining bi-directional mapping logic between core types and SDK models. |
