#### B. High-Cohesion Step Implementations ($LCOM4 = 1$, Cyclomatic Complexity $< 5$)

Every step class operates on a single state context and exports a simple entry point:

```typescript
// src/domain/steps/calculate-tax.step.ts
import { Order, TaxDetails } from "../models/order";
import { TaxCalculatorPort } from "../ports/tax-calculator.port";

export class CalculateTaxStep {
  constructor(private readonly taxCalculator: TaxCalculatorPort) {}

  public async execute(order: Order): Promise<Order> {
    if (order.isTaxExempt) {
      return { ...order, tax: 0 };
    }

    const taxDetails = await this.taxCalculator.calculateTax(order);
    return { ...order, tax: taxDetails.amount };
  }
}
```

